# Your rule content

## Frontmatter
- we use frontmatter. e.g.: 
---
title: "Become a bash pro: sed"
date: "2024-01-10"
description: From 0 to sed
featured_image_url: https://miro.medium.com/max/2000/1*v4o2AXLIJaHSZmqYZk26qA.jpeg
tags:
  - tech
---

- do not leave any whitespace or empty lines above the frontmatter
- for `date`, default to today's date 
- for `featured_image_url`, leave as ''
- for `tags` and `description` and `title`, generate a first suggestion based on the file name

## Blog post content
- in markdown
- written in a terse, pithy style

## Valid tags
- work
- food
- travel
- tech
- idea
